recipe:
modifySelected changes the currently selected object. User MUST select an object first.

Available properties:
- fill: change color → {"fill": "#ff0000"}
- stroke: add/change border → {"stroke": "#ffffff", "strokeWidth": 2}
- fontSize: change text size → {"fontSize": 24}
- fontFamily: change font → {"fontFamily": "Arial"}
- fontWeight: bold/normal → {"fontWeight": "bold"}
- opacity: transparency → {"opacity": 0.5}
- angle: rotation → {"angle": 45}
- scaleX/scaleY: resize → {"scaleX": 1.5, "scaleY": 1.5}
- text: change text content → {"text": "new text"}

Example — make selected text red, bold, larger:
```tool
{"tool": "modifySelected", "params": {"fill": "#ff0000", "fontWeight": "bold", "fontSize": 36}}
```

Example — add white border + make semi-transparent:
```tool
{"tool": "modifySelected", "params": {"stroke": "#ffffff", "strokeWidth": 3, "opacity": 0.8}}
```

If nothing is selected, tell user: 'Lütfen önce değiştirmek istediğiniz nesneyi seçin (canvas'ta tıklayın).'
